## 4. Defect Status Update

I selected the **Instagram Login defect** and updated its status through the Bug Life Cycle.

| Status       | Comment Added                                                                   |
| ------------ | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |
| **New**      | Defect logged successfully and waiting for review.                              |
| **Assigned** | The defect has been assigned to the developer for investigation.                |
| **Fixed**    | The developer fixed the issue causing the Login button to remain disabled.      |
| **Retest**   | The tester retested the login functionality after the fix was deployed.         |
| **Closed**   | The issue was verified successfully, and the Login button is working correctly. |

**Final Status:** **Closed**

